724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bace448df5bd283f\" href=\"?note=bace448df5bd283f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-language-formula.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-forcing-language-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(G,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (forcing-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (generic-extension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension\">58-df-generic-extension</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (formula-set operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (name-evaluation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (typed forcing-formula predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (assignment predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak N,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak N,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (typed structure and satisfaction predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameTupleRealization}_S(\\tau,\\varphi,\\eta,M,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{NameTupleRealization}_S(\\tau,\\varphi,\\eta,M,P)\\)</span> 为下式定义的转换关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 以自由变元为键，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 以有限序数为定义域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>七参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,P,R,G,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,P,R,G,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\tau\">\\(\\vec\\tau\\)</span> 继续采用原有 forcing-language 文件定义的自由变元名字赋值编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NameTupleRealization}_S(\\tau,\\varphi,\\eta,M,P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\eta,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\eta)\\subseteq M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,n,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau(i),P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\to\\tau(i)=\\eta(v_i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{NameTupleRealization}_S(\\tau,\\varphi,\\eta,M,P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\eta,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\eta)\\subseteq M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,n,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau(i),P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\to\\tau(i)=\\eta(v_i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\Sigma=\\mathcal L_\\in\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\tau,N,\\mathfrak N,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NameTupleRealization}_S(\\tau,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak N,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak N,s)\n\\land\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\;\\exists x\\in N\\;\n(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\vec\\tau(v),G,\\mathbb P)\\land s(v)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in G\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\Sigma=\\mathcal L_\\in\n\\land\\operatorname{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\tau,N,\\mathfrak N,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NameTupleRealization}_S(\\tau,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,M,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak N,N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak N,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak N,s)\n\\land\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\Sigma}(\\varphi)\\;\\exists x\\in N\\;\n(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\vec\\tau(v),G,\\mathbb P)\\land s(v)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in G\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\varphi,\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order and ground-model arguments required by the six-place forcing relation are explicit.  Name values are transferred to a genuine assignment for a selected satisfaction recursion, so no untyped tuple-substitution notation remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic-ext